-- Source module: Solutions.KFWStep2
/-!
# KFW: expressions over a register assignment, and the uniform phase step

* `ExV σ e v B`: on every background agreeing with `σ`, `e` is defined, evaluates to `v`, and
  all its values have at most `B` bits (constructors `ExV.reg`, `ExV.lit`, `ExV.add`, …);
  `ExC σ e v c`: the same with cost `≤ c`.  `pushSeq_cons`, `pushSeq_nil`: building `PushSeq`.
* **`stepQ_phase`**: a phase step `phase w k₀ k₁ a` on the node roles (`phC'`), via
  `rImplQ_onRole`, `sImplQ_push` (the constant `u mod 4` on `wU`), `sImplQ_phase` and
  `epsOK_tab`.
-/

set_option linter.unusedSimpArgs false
set_option linter.unusedVariables false
set_option linter.unusedSectionVars false

